==Battleground==
*8 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20.67~23.33 seconds<sup>620f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 15.33 seconds<sup>460f</sup>, delay 10~12.67 seconds<sup>300f~380f</sup>.
*4 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 12.67~16 seconds<sup>380f~480f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~44 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,320f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Treat this stage as you would an early [[The Aku Realms]] stage with the addition of a [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]].  This stage shouldn't be too hard for any player that has fought against Aku enemies before.

